# http-runtime-gauntlet — EAV port core (apps/http-runtime-gauntlet, webServer).
#
# The HTTP server loop is DEFERRED (README §34/WS3-017, gated behind
# sigs/standard.http.semsig). Per X-044 this ports the conformance scaffolding so
# it parses + lints clean: an `HttpServer`-style `webServer` entity whose route /
# notFound / methodNotAllowed handler ABIs are validated by WS2-026. The harness
# also RUNS each handler directly (server-free) through a console driver that
# invokes the health handler with a stub request/response and prints its status,
# so the handler logic JIT-runs and builds to an exe today.

HttpRuntimeGauntlet is project
HttpRuntimeGauntlet module appHttpGauntlet
HttpRuntimeGauntlet target console
HttpRuntimeGauntlet entry main

appHttpGauntlet is module
appHttpGauntlet path apps.httpRuntimeGauntlet
appHttpGauntlet exports main
appHttpGauntlet purpose "Validate handler ABIs and run a handler directly (server loop deferred)"
appHttpGauntlet invariant "Handlers conform to the §14 ABI; the health handler returns 200"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
HttpRequest is alias
HttpRequest for OpaquePointer
HttpResponse is alias
HttpResponse for OpaquePointer

stdoutWriter is capability
stdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
stdoutWriter purpose "Allow controlled writes to standard output"

gauntletServer is webServer
gauntletServer host home
gauntletServer port 8080
gauntletServer route GET /health healthHandler
gauntletServer notFound notFoundHandler
gauntletServer methodNotAllowed methodNotAllowedHandler

healthHandler is operation
healthHandler in request HttpRequest
healthHandler in response HttpResponse
healthHandler out Int32
healthHandler async no
healthHandler purpose "Return 200 for a health probe"
healthHandler invariant "Always returns the OK status"
healthHandler let okStatus immutable Int32 200
healthHandler return okStatus

notFoundHandler is operation
notFoundHandler in request HttpRequest
notFoundHandler in response HttpResponse
notFoundHandler out Int32
notFoundHandler async no
notFoundHandler purpose "Return 404 for an unmatched route"
notFoundHandler invariant "Always returns the not-found status"
notFoundHandler let notFoundStatus immutable Int32 404
notFoundHandler return notFoundStatus

methodNotAllowedHandler is operation
methodNotAllowedHandler in request HttpRequest
methodNotAllowedHandler in response HttpResponse
methodNotAllowedHandler out Int32
methodNotAllowedHandler async no
methodNotAllowedHandler purpose "Return 405 for a disallowed method"
methodNotAllowedHandler invariant "Always returns the method-not-allowed status"
methodNotAllowedHandler let methodStatus immutable Int32 405
methodNotAllowedHandler return methodStatus

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect write console.stdout
main uses stdoutWriter
main async no
main memory heap no
main purpose "Invoke the health handler directly (server-free) and print its status"
main invariant "Prints the health handler's 200 status"
main let stubRequest immutable HttpRequest 0
main let stubResponse immutable HttpResponse 0
main let okCode immutable ExitCode 0
main do callHealth
main do showStatus
main return okCode

callHealth is call
callHealth in main
callHealth invokes healthHandler
callHealth arg request HttpRequest stubRequest
callHealth arg response HttpResponse stubResponse
callHealth out status Int32

showStatus is call
showStatus in main
showStatus invokes console.writeIntegerLine
showStatus arg value Int64 status
